config-connector-extensions patch 0059: mockgcp's secrets.patch takes
versionDestroyTtl in its update mask.

SecretManagerSecret (ours, secretmanager.gcp.hfl.dev; foundation item
26) serves versionDestroyTtl, which Config Connector's types have as
NOTYET. The API's patch takes it in the update mask; mockgcp refused it
("update_mask path not valid"). Upstream candidate: yes, with the
field.

--- a/mockgcp/mocksecretmanager/secrets.go
+++ b/mockgcp/mocksecretmanager/secrets.go
@@ -165,6 +165,8 @@
 			updated.Topics = req.Secret.GetTopics()
 		case "customerManagedEncryption":
 			updated.CustomerManagedEncryption = req.Secret.GetCustomerManagedEncryption()
+		case "versionDestroyTtl":
+			updated.VersionDestroyTtl = req.Secret.GetVersionDestroyTtl()
 		case "rotation":
 			updated.Rotation = req.Secret.GetRotation()
 			if len(req.Secret.GetTopics()) == 0 {
